  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - The draugr rains frost from above.
  - The draugr spews continous streams of frost from his hands.
  - The draugr unleashes a miniature blizzard in the room.
  - The draugr flings frost from the side.
  - The draugr reaches out his cold, cold hands...!
  randomAttacks:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: a6e1d4f2bd10ed54eb6ffba05eb7b3a7, type: 2}
